{"ref":"BDB, בָּלֶה","hw":"בָּלֶה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלֶה</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. worn out</strong>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:43\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.43\">Ez 23:43</a> (of a woman, cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:12\" href=\"/Genesis.18.12\">Gn 18:12</a> supr.); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:4\" href=\"/Joshua.9.4\">Jos 9:4</a> (sacks), v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:4\" href=\"/Joshua.9.4\">4</a> (wine-skins), <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלוֹת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:5\" href=\"/Joshua.9.5\">5</a> (sandals), v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:5\" href=\"/Joshua.9.5\">5</a> (garments).","next":"BDB, בְּלוֹא","prev":"BDB, בָּלָה²"}